Notebook[{
Cell["Geodesic Convexity Analysis \[LongDash] Induced Metric Optimiser", \
"Title",ExpressionUUID->"66390b13-4a4a-43de-a38e-9b20ca07e662"],

Cell["What This Notebook Proves", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"5c98893b-5344-4fca-8d6e-beebf8aecfad"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This notebook asks a natural question about the induced metric optimiser: \
",
 StyleBox["does the metric make the loss landscape \"more convex\" in a \
geometric sense?",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "The short answer is: ",
 StyleBox["no \[LongDash] but it does something useful anyway.",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " The induced metric uniformly damps all curvatures by a position-dependent \
factor, acting as smooth gradient clipping. It cannot convert a saddle point \
into a minimum, but it prevents the optimiser from taking dangerously large \
steps in steep regions while preserving the local geometry near minima."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"88f87164-2895-47b9-8d36-c33fbd07f5c9"],

Cell["\<\
Every formula below is verified symbolically by Mathematica. The structure is:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8a7cfa8b-ba7d-4762-bbe9-9016cebbfcc6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "1. ",
 StyleBox["Background",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " \[LongDash] what the induced metric is and why we care about geodesic \
convexity"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b767e6f1-3d6d-4560-ae80-c3a518029fd6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "2. ",
 StyleBox["Christoffel symbols",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " \[LongDash] the connection coefficients that encode how \"curved\" the \
metric is"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c3642dfe-7442-4a70-9db9-562435bd1acc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "3. ",
 StyleBox["Riemannian Hessian",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " \[LongDash] the curvature of the loss function as seen through the metric"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e4b4e4d1-36c3-4cd8-acc1-6b650e4e4a13"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "4. ",
 StyleBox["Gauss equation",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " \[LongDash] an independent derivation via the extrinsic geometry of the \
embedding"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7e41d291-b074-4c54-acd9-163bcedc6b44"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "5. ",
 StyleBox["Eigenvalue analysis",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " \[LongDash] what happens to convexity, condition numbers, and saddle points"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1671ef0e-c634-460d-be3d-ef12e3743e44"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "6. ",
 StyleBox["Off-diagonal extension",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " \[LongDash] whether the more general metric can do better"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d6910b47-5592-40f9-b8f0-6ad6c9eb3b39"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "7. ",
 StyleBox["Numerical verification",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " \[LongDash] checking everything on concrete test functions "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6d7b30d6-de6f-413d-bffe-a0674f24a313"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]},
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   FrameStyle->Directive[
     LightDarkSwitched[
